# Ship only the neutral demo and named first-party packages. Everything else
# here — the Methods and Routines you create or install — is local-private.
# Publish from inside the app to reach the community store; created/installed
# content never belongs in this framework repo.
methods/*
routines/*

# Kept as the out-of-the-box demo seed:
!methods/README.md
!methods/sample-summary/
!routines/sample-summary-log/

# H-014 first-party result views (declarative package pairs only):
!methods/vaenyx-receipt-record/
!methods/vaenyx-warranty-manual-record/
!methods/vaenyx-material-takeoff/
!routines/vaenyx-receipt-record/
!routines/vaenyx-warranty-manual-record/
!routines/vaenyx-material-takeoff/
